                                "Unexpected debug pixel at sub-block " + x + "," + y + " pixel " + px + "," + py);
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        assertEquals(1, mb.getUSubBlock(0, 0).getDest()[0][0]);
        assertEquals(1, mb.getVSubBlock(0, 0).getDest()[0][0]);
    }

